diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index 94a5a6d..a388aa6 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,16 @@
+libdisplay-info (0.3.0-1ubuntu1~hdr1) stonking; urgency=medium
+
+  * Local detection-only DisplayID2 backport, preserving the 0.3 public ABI.
+  * Privately reuse nested CTA parsing with owned partial-failure cleanup.
+  * Derive RGB BT.2020/PQ only from one validated native block and when both
+    CTA HDR/colorimetry domains are absent; leave Type 1/luminance unknown.
+  * Conservatively suppress native fallback for identified unusable nested
+    CTA, including incomplete headers, while retaining valid CTA authority.
+  * Add EDID-only regression, old-header ABI and nested-allocation tests;
+    document the unresolved Mutter/i915 signaling dependency.
+
+ -- Paul Junod <donujp@gmail.com>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 23:21:31 -0400
+
 libdisplay-info (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium
 
   * New upstream release (Closes: #1116041).
diff --git a/debian/patches/native-displayid-hdr.patch b/debian/patches/native-displayid-hdr.patch
new file mode 100644
